 "description": "I share my life as an Electrician every day! I'm 35 years old and started my electrical apprenticeship back in 2012 through the non-union. I worked non-union from 2012 to 2020 (8.5 years). I joined the IBEW 48 (Union) in January 2021 and been working for them since. Collectively I've been working as an electrician now for over 14 years. I enjoy sharing my life experiences, teaching others, and helping you all out through videos and answering questions. My goal is to become a youtuber full time one day.\n\nI hope my content brings you knowledge, entertainment, laughter and enjoyment. Stick around and join my growing community! Thanks for the support!\n\nAlso the World's Greatest Fruit Mountain Player :)\n\nGod bless!\n",
